About the Project

A simple C program that calculates student attendance percentages and identifies students with attendance below 75%.

Features

* Takes attendance input for 10 students.
* Calculates attendance percentage.
* Displays a student-wise attendance report.
* Identifies students below 75% attendance.

Technologies Used

* C Programming
* VS Code
* GCC Compiler

Formula

Attendance % = (Classes Attended / Total Classes) × 100

